Recommends: libappindicator3-1
Description: Rapid Serial Visual Presentation reader
 OpenRSVP is a desktop reader that streams documents word-by-word at a chosen
 speed, with Spritz-style Optimal Recognition Point highlighting. Supports
 PDF, EPUB, DOCX/DOC, TXT, Markdown, HTML and live URLs. The package ships
 a prebuilt Electron application; no compilation is required at install time.
